  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseWeaponTurret">
    <defName>Gun_HG_SirenTurret</defName>
    <label>VnD-10M Siren (Turret)</label>
    <description>The one lasting design VnD produced before being swallowed up by the Helghan megacorps, the VnD-10m is available in man-portable and emplacement form as a reliable no-nonsense automatic grenade launcher. Infantry like to use it on the go to cover assault teams or for base defense against swarm targets. It remains a heavy, cumbersome weapon. When deployed as an emplacement, most of its questionable accuracy concerns are dismissed.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Helghast/Structures/Turrets/TurretSiren_Top</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
